            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jane"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The product was excellent! I used mini M &amp; Ms, included the coffee liqueur...and I have to say that the taste is superb. No need to spray the pans with non-stick, as some suggested. They slid right off the pan! I also used a cookie scoop to form the cookies. The dough seemed too moist for rolling in balls by hand. This is a keeper.",
